          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyut 1.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gin tye awot, awinyo kite ame bwomgi tye awoo kede, kun calo pii ame tye amol atek. Winyere calo twon mony adwoŋ meicel ame aciro, onyo calo dwon Obaŋa Won Twer Ducu. Ka ce gin ocuŋ odolo bwomgi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dwonnoro te bino i ŋe gin ame opette ame tye i wi leyi aŋwennono, i kare ame gin ocuŋ mot, gin te dwoko bwomgi oko piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.25",
